""" Matrix multiplication is an associative operation, however by changing 
    the bracketing of the multiplication of three matrices, we construct two different
    intermediate matrices. Try clicking on the corresponding cell of both output matrices,
    and see what happens in the data-pane. """
(MultiView { 
    firstMatrix: matMul (matMul aMatrix bMatrix) cMatrix,
    secondMatrix: matMul aMatrix (matMul bMatrix cMatrix)
})
